# Home Assistant safety

## Read-only default

List entities and states are fine when Home Assistant work is authorized.
Do **not**:

- call services that unlock doors, disarm alarms, open garage, or control HVAC
  setpoints without an explicit verb naming the entity
- delete automations, scripts, or helpers
- restart Home Assistant / reload all YAML unless asked
- bulk-turn-off unrelated domains

…unless the user gave an explicit verb this turn naming the object(s).

Never paste long-lived access tokens into chat. Prefer scoped service calls.
